      "passage": [
        {
          "text": "The local gardeners began their community gardens plan with one short meeting. (16) ..... The next week, more residents arrived than expected. (17) ..... They wanted to keep the activity useful rather than simply make it larger. (18) ..... The organisers therefore asked members to choose one task each. (19) ..... The work became easier to manage, and new volunteers quickly understood what to do. (20) ..... The project now meets regularly and welcomes anyone who wants to take part."
