          "label": "A",
          "text": "This was the first sign that the idea might work."
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "For that reason, the group changed its meeting place."
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "As a result, several people offered to help."
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "The organisers had not expected such a quick response."
        },
        {
          "label": "E",
          "text": "Even so, the original aim remained the same."
